"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 15, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 15, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "100% féminine\n", "textStyle": {"backgroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.92941177, "green": 0.65882355, "red": 0.8509804}}}, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 34, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 33, "startIndex": 15, "textRun": {"content": "Boxe 100% féminin ", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 34, "startIndex": 33, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"backgroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.92941177, "green": 0.65882355, "red": 0.8509804}}}, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 15}, {"endIndex": 489, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 488, "startIndex": 34, "textRun": {"content": "Pour répondre à une demande plus que nécessaire, FightxLife a mis en place des cours de kick-boxing encadré par des coachs professionnelles femmes exclusivement réservés aux FEMMES. Rassembler les femmes entre elles permettra a Fightxlife de les sensibiliser chacune au cancer, de leur donner confiance en elles et de leur ouvrir la porte au monde du sport. Le kick-boxing est un sport de combat qui combine différentes techniques de poings et de pieds. ", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 489, "startIndex": 488, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 34}, {"endIndex": 560, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 559, "startIndex": 489, "textRun": {"content": "Quelle que soit ta condition physique ou ton expérience, rejoins-nous!", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 14, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.6431373, "green": 0.21960784, "red": 1}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 560, "startIndex": 559, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 20, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.6431373, "green": 0.21960784, "red": 1}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 150, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 489}, {"endIndex": 581, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 581, "startIndex": 560, "textRun": {"content": "Bienfait de la boxe \n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.